{"id":"9f4cf4b7a0c464e0","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-morass-level.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal8 Morass Level","display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-morass-level — ZFC Ordinal8 Morass Level","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-morass-level","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal8-morass-level"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-morass-level — ZFC Ordinal8 Morass Level","depends_on":["[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-large-morass-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-morass-level"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal8-morass-level</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal8-morass-level — ZFC Ordinal8 Morass Level"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"952d622641f51ebe\" href=\"?note=952d622641f51ebe\" title=\"58-df-zfc-large-morass-structure\">58-df-zfc-large-morass-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\alpha,\\kappa,\\mathcal M,\\Theta,F,B_\\Theta\\in V\">\\(L,\\alpha,\\kappa,\\mathcal M,\\Theta,F,B_\\Theta\\in V\\)</span> (level, index, morass height, morass code, level map, transition map, and level-map codomain).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> is the ordinal predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> is the set-function predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargeMorassStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargeMorassStructure}_S\\)</span> (source predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8MorassLevel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8MorassLevel}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}morass\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8MorassLevel}_S(L,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\exists\\kappa,\\mathcal M,\\Theta,F,B_\\Theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\alpha\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLargeMorassStructure}_S(\\mathcal M,\\kappa)\\land\\mathcal M=\\langle\\Theta,F\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Theta,\\kappa+1,B_\\Theta)\\land L=\\Theta(\\alpha)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}morass\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8MorassLevel}_S(L,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\exists\\kappa,\\mathcal M,\\Theta,F,B_\\Theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\alpha\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLargeMorassStructure}_S(\\mathcal M,\\kappa)\\land\\mathcal M=\\langle\\Theta,F\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Theta,\\kappa+1,B_\\Theta)\\land L=\\Theta(\\alpha)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A level is extracted through the level-map component of a coherent morass code; the ordered-pair code <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> itself is not incorrectly applied as a function.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-large-morass-structure","status":"resolved","id":"952d622641f51ebe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-large-morass-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ is the ordinal predicate from [[58-df-ordinal]].","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ is the set-function predicate from [[58-df-function]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,\\alpha,\\kappa,\\mathcal M,\\Theta,F,B_\\Theta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLargeMorassStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8MorassLevel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}morass\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8MorassLevel}_S(L,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\exists\\kappa,\\mathcal M,\\Theta,F,B_\\Theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\alpha\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLargeMorassStructure}_S(\\mathcal M,\\kappa)\\land\\mathcal M=\\langle\\Theta,F\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Theta,\\kappa+1,B_\\Theta)\\land L=\\Theta(\\alpha)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false}],"bytes":1444,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3012","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-morass-level.md|58-df-zfc-ordinal8-morass-level]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15a33c2","36d7463d215be751","952d622641f51ebe"]}